      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Unlike most of the comments here, i agree with whats being suggested. As an older member of the vrc community there has been talk of how vrc is going to keep afloat, and where the paywall is going to br implemented. I like the idea of making a one time payment to vrc to upload content to their servers. This fee would not bother my experience. But on the other hand, i cam see how some people would not like this, especially with all the \"100% original, not downloaded\" content most people have.\n\nI would add one thing to this post and that would be the addition of a commissioner tag in the vrc api which would allow you to upload to other accounts without being able to get full access and wipe the account. This i could see being a viable option as not everyone has the time of knowhow to upload working PERFORMANT avatars or worlds.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
