      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 4
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For those of you complaining oh this will kill vrchat. Oh why do i have to pay for a feature that i already have for free now? Please actually think for more than a few seconds. This would not take away your ability to chat with anyone. This won't affect the normal gameplay you are getting for free. You could still favourite avatars you find in worlds and use them. \n\nAll this will do is reduce the amount of trolls and hackers in the game because each time they are banned and want to make a new account they would keep having to pay more to do so. It is a one time fee. Considering how much we have been enjoying for hours and hours without even giving back to the developers don't you think that is wrong? Literally every other \"free\" game has some form of payment to get access to more features. What is wrong with a one time payment to be able to upload anything within the guidlines? A lot of you are so quick to dismiss this because you don't want to pay anything. You pay so much for other games. Why not this one?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
