      "value": "no. As much as I would like to support the vrchat development... I am not able to pay any money to anybody online. Even if I wanted to. And most of my freetime constists of blender and unity. That change would destroy my freetime, hobbies, etc. \n.\nI would never vote for something like this, and I would rather downvote it if that would be possible.\nI'm a great fan of FLOSS (free/libre open source software) and I would rather want VRChat to go open surce, than that.",
