      "value": "@{5ac4fd763f8d523278a414f7|full_name}: yes it is one of the fun things about the game. And many people have been abusing that system to ruin the game for those continously playing the game and for newcomers alike. The amount of times i have been crashed or forced to watch something unpleasant and down right disturbing is numerous and it drives people away from the game. A small one time fee for the peace of mind from obscene amounts of hacking and disruption is something i am fine with. Also ERP is technically against vrchat policy anyway. Even then all you need to ERP is just two people. There needs to be proper consequences in place for bad behaviour. If people weren't complete assholes and would stop doing shit like we keep seeing then we wouldn't  NEED this. If you can come up with a solution that fixes the issues that we keep seeing go ahead and come up with a better method that would solve these issues",
